# TESTING AUDIT MODE

Analyze:

* Unit tests
* Integration tests
* Feature tests
* E2E tests
* Critical business flows
* Authentication
* Authorization
* Data integrity
* External integrations
* Edge cases
* Failure scenarios

Do not judge quality only by coverage percentage.

Prioritize critical behavior.

Identify:

* Missing tests
* Fragile tests
* Duplicate tests
* Slow tests
* Flaky tests
* Poor test isolation

Provide a prioritized testing roadmap.
